	(text "Notes:\nDual strain-gauge channel:\n*1 ADC\n*2 Wheatstone bridges (350 Ω).\n*Each gauge connects individually (2 pins per arm); the bridge is built on the PCB.\nSignals:\n*SPI_SCK/MOSI/MISO shared\n*CS + DRDY per ADC\n*SHUNT_CAL drives both switches.\nGrounds: \n*GNDA = analog (ADC AVSS, bridge, filter caps)\n*GND = digital/ESD/shield.\n*GNDA and GND are joined at a single net tie near the ADCs (top sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4317e7e5-df4a-46e6-adc5-a4559076c2a2")
	)
